              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wu EJAKAIT, kiira; wu EJAKAIT, kisioni: wu EJAKAIT, kopup, kiswama; sirikiyap; kanukon, wu Ekadeke, naarai emaikinitai erekon ka ituŋakon ekonikiror.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
